1
00:00:00,752 --> 00:00:02,622
(Leonard:)No.

2
00:00:03,455 --> 00:00:04,755
(Bernadette:)I have one.

3
00:00:04,756 --> 00:00:06,626
(Bernadette:)What if you got
a giant slingshot

4
00:00:06,625 --> 00:00:08,795
(Bernadette:)and flung yourself
into the wall?

5
00:00:10,495 --> 00:00:12,095
(Howard:)Is that supposed
to be funny?

6
00:00:12,097 --> 00:00:13,627
(Raj:)Hold on.

7
00:00:20,372 --> 00:00:22,242
(Raj:)Yeah, that's funny.

8
00:00:24,443 --> 00:00:26,673
- All right, we're heading out.
- Mm-hmm.

9
00:00:26,678 --> 00:00:29,208
(Amy:)I'll call you when
we get to the hotel.

10
00:00:29,214 --> 00:00:31,814
(Sheldon:)And if they have any of those
tiny bottles of shampoo?

11
00:00:31,817 --> 00:00:33,547
(Amy:)I will bring them home
so you can show me

12
00:00:33,552 --> 00:00:34,882
(Amy:)how Godzilla takes a shower.

13
00:00:36,521 --> 00:00:37,821
(Leonard:)Have fun.
Thanks.

14
00:00:37,823 --> 00:00:38,853
(Penny:)Are you ready?

15
00:00:38,857 --> 00:00:40,257
(Amy:)Uh-huh.

16
00:00:40,258 --> 00:00:41,658
(Amy:)Bye, Sheldon.

17
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:43,060
(Penny:)You know what?

18
00:00:43,061 --> 00:00:45,431
(Sheldon:)I feel uncomfortable engaging
in a public display of affection

19
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:48,060
(Sheldon:)while their relationship
is strained.

20
00:00:48,066 --> 00:00:50,836
(Leonard:)Go ahead, it's fine.

21
00:00:50,836 --> 00:00:59,026
(Amy:)Bye.
Bye.

